OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet and windy start with
OL,6,Frain, heavy at times, especially over
OL,7,Fhigher ground. Rain clearing by
OL,8,Flunchtime with a mix of sunshine and
OL,9,Fblustery showers this afternoon. A
OL,10,Fmild start but turning cooler later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRemaining blustery overnight
OL,13,Fwith further showers. The showers most
OL,14,Ffrequent in the north, with some
OL,15,Fpotentially thundery and a risk of
OL,16,Fhail. A colder night than last night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
