OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA blustery and cold feeling
OL,6,Fday with further showers. Showers
OL,7,Fturning heavy and thundery at times,
OL,8,Fwith the best of any sunshine across
OL,9,Fthe south.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA
OL,12,Fcalmer end to the weekend with some
OL,13,Fsunny spells on Sunday. Some rain and
OL,14,Fbrisk winds return early next week,
OL,15,Fbut also turning milder by day and by
OL,16,Fnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
